message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository and the exact commit."
title: "Financial Time-Series Forecasting: Three Notebook Projects"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tran
    given-names: Tuan
repository-code: "https://github.com/tuanthescientist/Timeseries_Forecasting_Research_and_Build"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
abstract: >-
  Three original financial forecasting workflows: VN30 with NeuralProphet, Bitcoin
  daily Low with a TensorFlow attention model, and BID with scikit-learn ExtraTrees.
  Saved forecasts, error metrics and evaluation limitations are documented. A separate
  supplementary study provides rolling-origin and interval-calibration infrastructure.
keywords:
  - time-series forecasting
  - neuralprophet
  - tensorflow
  - scikit-learn
  - financial time series
